  "summary": "Users report that selecting specific songs triggers playback of completely different tracks, severely disrupting intended listening sessions [#rv_-7589450099845676560] [#rv_-8295696482615364440]. This issue extends to playlists, where the app switches to random songs or foreign content not in the user's library [#rv_4877225128663681837] [#rv_3330890961785893525]. Many users note this behavior is a recent regression, stating the app previously functioned correctly before these glitches began [#rv_1948492864084987853] [#rv_-7589450099845676560]. Additionally, some users experience the app playing only short samples instead of full tracks when they attempt to listen to their chosen music [#rv_1948492864084987853] [#rv_-3620137867435867824]."
